## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00 — Thứ Ba: Giải thích khái niệm

### 16:30–16:40 · Shadowing

### 16:40–16:55 · Nói to có ghi âm

**Chủ đề: deep linking, và chỗ nó hay hỏng.**

> *"There are two kinds and the difference matters.*
> *A custom scheme like macrozone-colon-slash-slash only needs configuration inside the app. It's quick, but any other app can register the same scheme, and if the app isn't installed the link just does nothing. Universal Links and App Links use a real https URL and require a file hosted on your domain, so the OS can verify you own it. If the app isn't installed, the link opens the website instead — which is what you want for anything you share.*
> *The part that actually breaks in practice is cold start. If the app is closed and you tap a link, the app launches and the router tries to navigate — but the session is still being read from secure storage. So the auth guard sees no session, redirects to sign-in, and the deep link is swallowed. It works fine when you test it with the app already open, and then fails for real users.*
> *The fix is to hold the pending link until the session state is resolved, and only then navigate.*
> *One more thing people skip: deep link parameters are untrusted input. Anyone can send your app any URL. I validate them with Zod and show a proper error screen rather than querying with whatever came in."*

### 16:55–17:00 · 5 từ mới

| Từ / cụm | Nghĩa | Câu mẫu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `swallow` (v) | nuốt mất, làm mất | *The deep link is swallowed.* |
| `resolve` (v) | xác định xong | *Until the session state is resolved.* |
| `untrusted input` | đầu vào không đáng tin | *Deep link params are untrusted input.* |
| `register a scheme` | đăng ký scheme | *Any app can register the same scheme.* |
| `hold` (v) | giữ lại chờ xử lý | *Hold the pending link.* |

